*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
* SELECTION-SCREEN
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF SCREEN 0110 AS SUBSCREEN.
  SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF LINE.
    SELECTION-SCREEN POSITION 1.
    SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT (10) FOR FIELD P_VBELN .
    PARAMETERS : P_VBELN LIKE VBAK-VBELN OBLIGATORY .     "판매오더

    SELECTION-SCREEN POSITION 45.
    SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT (10) FOR FIELD P_KUNNR MODIF ID KN.  "판매처
    PARAMETERS : P_KUNNR LIKE VBAK-KUNNR MODIF ID KN.

    SELECTION-SCREEN POSITION 68 .
    SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT (20) GV_NAME1 MODIF ID KN.           "판매처명

  SELECTION-SCREEN END OF LINE.

  SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF LINE.
    SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT (10) FOR FIELD P_REQT.  "요청구분
    PARAMETERS : P_REQT LIKE ZGTSDT1410-REQTYPE ."OBLIGATORY.
    SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT (10) GV_REQTT .           "요청구분명

    SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT 45(10) FOR FIELD P_REASON .  "정정사유
    SELECTION-SCREEN POSITION 56.
    PARAMETERS : P_REASON LIKE ZGTSDT1410-REASON ."OBLIGATORY.

    SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT (25) GV_REAT .           "정정사유명

  SELECTION-SCREEN END OF LINE.


  SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF LINE.
    SELECTION-SCREEN POSITION 1.
    SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT 1(10) FOR FIELD P_EDATUN.  "납기정정일
    PARAMETERS : P_EDATUN LIKE ZGTSDT1410-EDATU_N.

    SELECTION-SCREEN POSITION 15.
    SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT 45(10) FOR FIELD P_READTL .  "세부원인
    PARAMETERS : P_READTL LIKE ZGTSDT1410-READTL . "OBLIGATORY.

  SELECTION-SCREEN END OF LINE.

  SELECTION-SCREEN SKIP 1.

SELECTION-SCREEN END OF SCREEN 0110 .
